nd them), the person as a contact, and the card image as evidence. On an existing customer only blank fields are filled.\n\n  Shape:\n    { card: { person_name?: string; job_title?: string; company_name?: string; legal_name?: string; reg_no?: string; tin?: string; sst_no?: string; industry?: string; email?: string; company_email?: string; phone?: string; mobile?: string; office_phone?: string; website?: string; address?: string | { line1?: string; line2?: string; line3?: string; postcode?: string; city?: string; state?: string; country?: string; }; }; customer_id?: string; image_path?: string; allow_duplicate?: boolean; }\n\ndocument-intelligence_save_package\n  Create or update a package (bundle). price omitted = sum of items. Passing items replaces the item list.\n\n  Parameters:\n    id (string)\n    code (string)\n    name (string)\n    description (string)\n    price\n      anyOf:\n        - number\n        - null\n    tax_code (string)\n    is_active (boolean)\n    items (array)\n      items (object)\n        product (string) *required* - SKU or id\n        quantity (number)\n    custom (object) - Custom field values (keys must be defined by the DB Manager)\n\ndocument-intelligence_save_product\n  Create a product/service (SKU auto-made if omitted) or update one by id.\n\n  Parameters:\n    id (string)\n    sku (string)\n    name (string)\n    description (string)\n    category (string)\n    unit (string) - unit, set, hour, month, kWp…\n    unit_price (number)\n    tax_code (string)\n    is_active (boolean)\n    custom (object) - Custom field values (keys must be defined by the DB Manager)"}],"details":{"mode":"search","matches":[{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_get_company_profile","score":453},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_get_customer","score":443},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-intelligence_archive_record","score":433},{"server":"document-intelligence","tool":"document-int